**What was built** (`crates/gently-core/src/graph/` — `mod.rs` + `attributes.rs`)
- **c1/p1**: `add_node` interns by name — duplicate names merge, existing index returned (upstream add_node); `add_anonymous_node` creates distinct unnamed nodes; `node_by_name("")` → None
- **c2/p2**: `AttributeTable` stores every key/value **verbatim**; `Scope::{Node,Edge,Group,Graph,Class}` tables fully independent; `border` derives `border_style`/`border_width`/`border_color` **at assignment time**, exactly as upstream 0.69 `split_border_attributes` (fetched & ported: leftmost-position style word scan, default `solid`, unit-required `\d+(px|em|%)` width digits-only, `0`→none)
- **c3/p3**: `add_edge` rejects non-live endpoints (`None`); self-loops legal; `remove_node` drops incident edges and re-indexes survivors (upstream `del_node`), out-of-range removal is a no-op
- **c4/p4**: `Edge{directed, arrows:{start,end}}` with directed/undirected/bidirectional constructors; bit-exact through clone + accessors
- **c5/p5**: published `nodes()`/`edges()`/`get_attr`/`set_attr` contract asserted equal to direct inspection
- Groups left as documented stub (`Group{name,attributes}`, `add_group`) — no membership semantics
- Parser `intern` now routes through the model's own `add_node`

