**Deviations**
- The brief prescribed `flags = "scenarios::ge_graph_model::pN"`, but libtest matches filters against the test path only (no target prefix) — that form runs 0 tests. I set `flags = "ge_graph_model::pN"`, the form that actually executes and passes under `ah check --run-tests` (the binding gate). Flag direction (hyphen→underscore) matches the brief's intent; the target-name prefix was dropped as unmatchable.
- `remove_node` re-indexes surviving edge endpoints (documented upstream-faithful choice); p3 asserts via out-of-range endpoints since post-removal indices renumber.

